window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-533036eaec307c04"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"set-up-a-work-chief-of-staff\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">设置工作统筹助理</h1> <p>掌握你的优先事项、会议、消息和承诺。</p> <p>将 ChatGPT Work 设置为工作统筹助理，让它每小时检查已连接的消息、电子邮件、 日历、文档和项目跟踪工具，跟踪变化，并准备简明更新和回复草稿。在桌面端，你还 可以让它为某个具体项目创建或协调一个独立任务。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要跨消息、电子邮件、日历、文档和项目跟踪工具管理优先事项与承诺的人。</li> <li>需要准备会议、作出决策并跟踪后续事项的工作日。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar（需联网）</a></td> <td>检查当天的会议、时间安排和准备需求。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail（需联网）</a></td> <td>找出 Gmail 中需要回复或会改变你优先事项的消息。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/outlook-email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">outlook-email（需联网）</a></td> <td>找出 Outlook 中需要回复或会改变你优先事项的消息。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>找出需要关注的私信、提及、决策和后续事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">teams（需联网）</a></td> <td>找出 Teams 中需要关注的消息、决策和后续事项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>读取经批准的持续更新笔记、跟踪表或当天工作所依据的规划文档。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>设置我的工作统筹助理</p> <p>建议模型：<code>gpt-6-luna</code> · 建议推理级别：<code>xhigh</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">做我的工作统筹助理。\n\n先检查你可以使用的工作工具和来源，例如 Slack 或 Teams、Gmail 或 Outlook、 我的日历、文档、笔记和项目跟踪工具。弄清楚我正在做什么、与谁合作、已经作出 哪些承诺，以及哪些事情需要我关注。\n\n给我一份简明更新，包含：\n\n- 发生了哪些变化，哪些事情需要决策；\n- 临近的截止时间、会议和承诺事项；\n- 需要回复的消息；\n- 哪些事情遇到阻碍或正在等待他人；以及\n- 哪些事情可以稍后处理。\n\n尽可能链接到原始来源；重新提醒旧请求之前，先查看最新回复；如果重要来源 不可用，请告诉我。区分已确认的事实和假设，不要重复已经解决的事项。\n\n在有帮助时，建议下一步、起草回复，并准备会议简报。在桌面应用中，当我要求 你委派一个项目时，创建或继续一个独立的项目任务，只分享它所需的背景资料。\n\n如果可以使用定时任务，就设置每小时检查。检查已连接的来源，与之前的更新 比较；只有当优先事项、截止时间、阻碍、决策或消息发生重要变化时，才打扰我。 没有新情况时保持安静。如果你无法创建定时计划，请告诉我，不要暗示它已生效。\n\n除了我刚才要求的每小时检查外，在创建新的项目任务、发送任何内容、编辑文档、 更改定时计划或作出承诺之前，都先询问我。\n\n先告诉我今天应当知道什么。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/project-teammate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">设置项目协作助理（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">定时任务</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾加上 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"what-to-expect\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">预期效果</h2> <p>让 ChatGPT Work 持续负责掌握你的工作动态。在同一个对话中，它可以每小时检查你已连接的工作工具、汇总优先事项、帮你准备会议，并指出需要你关注的消息、决策或承诺。在桌面应用中，当你提出要求时，它还可以帮助你为某个项目启动或协调一个独立任务。</p> <p>使用与你工作相关的来源，例如 Slack 或 Teams、Gmail 或 Outlook、日历、文档和项目跟踪工具。如果无法访问某个来源，ChatGPT 应告诉你，而不是猜测里面有什么。</p> <p>根据你希望这位工作统筹助理如何工作，选择合适的使用界面：</p> <ul> <li><strong>网页版 ChatGPT：</strong>使用已连接的工作工具和每小时运行的<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">定时检查（本地尚未收录）</a>，即使笔记本关机，检查也能继续。如果你希望无论身在何处都能收到更新，这是一个合适的默认选择。</li> <li><strong>ChatGPT 桌面应用：</strong>在使用相同已连接来源的同时，还能结合本地文件和应用。当你提出要求时，工作统筹助理还可以创建独立的项目协作助理、交代任务背景并协调它们。如果<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">定时检查（本地尚未收录）</a>需要本地文件或桌面工具，请让计算机保持开机、应用持续运行。</li> </ul> <p>首次检查和后续跟进可能如下所示：</p> <p><strong>最高优先事项</strong></p> <ul> <li>在上午 9:15 前与 Priya 确认发布文档链接，以便参加上午 9:30 的准备情况评审。</li> <li>准备准确的客户更新、回复财务部门，并检查每周更新。</li> </ul> <p><strong>发生的变化：</strong>发布文案已获批准，缺失的文档链接是当前的阻碍，之前的团队社交活动请求已解决。</p> <p><strong>回复草稿：</strong>“文案已获批准。我正在检查文档链接，会在准备情况评审之前确认。”在你批准之前，这条回复不会发送。</p> <p><strong>补看动态的提示词：</strong>我离开了一段时间，现在回来了。请检查我可用的消息、电子邮件、日历、文档和项目跟踪工具，帮我补看工作动态。告诉我发生了哪些变化，附上来源链接，不要发送或更改任何内容。</p> <p><a id=\"make-it-your-own\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">按你的需要调整</h2> <ol> <li>使用起步提示词开启一个对话。</li> <li>连接与你工作相关的消息、电子邮件、日历和文档来源。</li> <li>检查首次更新，指出重要、已解决或缺失的内容。</li> <li>继续在同一个对话中跟进事项、准备会议和起草回复。</li> <li>在桌面端，如果某个项目需要自己的协作助理，请让它创建或继续一个独立任务。</li> <li>检查每小时的定时跟进，并在需要时调整计划。</li> </ol> <p>起步提示词授权了每小时检查。在创建其他任务、发送消息、更新文档、更改计划或作出承诺之前，ChatGPT 应先询问你。</p> <p><strong>调整每小时的定时跟进</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check my connected work sources every hour. Tell me only about meaningful changes, approaching deadlines, decisions, blockers, or messages that need my attention. Don't repeat resolved items. Apart from this hourly check, keep everything read-only unless I approve a specific action.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">每小时检查一次我已连接的工作来源。只向我报告需要关注的重要变化、临近的截止日期、待决事项、阻碍或消息。不要重复已经解决的事项。除这项每小时检查外，其他操作一律保持只读，除非我批准某项具体行动。</div></div> <p><strong>离开后补看动态</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Catch me up on what changed while I was away. Review my available messages, email, calendar, documents, and project trackers. Show me decisions, deadlines, blockers, and messages that need a reply. Link to the original sources and tell me if anything is missing. Don't send or change anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请告诉我离开期间发生了哪些变化。查看我可访问的消息、电子邮件、日历、文档和项目跟踪表。列出需要作出的决定、截止日期、阻碍以及需要回复的消息。附上原始来源的链接，并告诉我是否缺少任何信息。不要发送或更改任何内容。</div></div> <p><strong>在桌面端启动项目协作助理</strong></p> <p>当某个项目需要专门的工作空间时，可以请工作统筹助理<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/project-teammate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">设置项目协作助理（本地尚未收录）</a>，并分享相关背景资料。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a separate teammate task for [project]. Brief it on what we're trying to accomplish, the relevant messages, documents, decisions, and open questions. Give it only the context it needs, keep its work separate from other projects, and tell me where to find it. Ask before sending messages, editing documents, or making commitments.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请为 [project] 创建一个独立的协作智能体任务。向它说明我们要实现的目标，以及相关消息、文档、决定和待解答的问题。只提供它需要的上下文，让它的工作与其他项目分开，并告诉我到哪里找到它。发送消息、编辑文档或作出承诺之前，先征求我的同意。</div></div> <p><strong>继续已有的项目协作助理任务</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check on my existing [project] teammate. Give it this follow-up: [what you need]. Then tell me what changed, what's blocked, and what needs my review. Don't create a duplicate task, contact anyone, or change anything without my approval.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请检查我现有的 [project] 协作智能体。向它发送以下跟进要求：[what you need]。然后告诉我发生了什么变化、哪些事项遇到阻碍，以及哪些内容需要我审阅。未经我批准，不要创建重复任务、联系任何人或更改任何内容。</div></div> <p><strong>准备下一步</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use the latest context in this thread to draft the reply, handoff, or meeting brief I need next. Keep it concise, show the sources behind your recommendation, and don't send or share anything without my approval.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请利用这段对话中的最新上下文，起草我接下来需要的回复、交接说明或会议简报。保持简洁，列明建议所依据的来源；未经我批准，不要发送或分享任何内容。</div></div> <p>已连接来源和定时任务是否可用，取决于你的套餐和工作区设置。请在聊天中设置定时任务，而不是在语音对话中设置。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"set-up-a-work-chief-of-staff\">Set up a work chief of staff</h1> <p>Stay on top of your priorities, meetings, messages, and commitments.</p> <p>Set up ChatGPT Work as a chief of staff that checks your connected messages, email, calendar, documents, and project trackers every hour, keeps track of what changes, and prepares concise updates and draft replies. On desktop, ask it to create or coordinate a separate task for a specific project.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>People managing priorities and commitments across messages, email, calendars, documents, and project trackers.</li> <li>Workdays with meetings to prepare for, decisions to make, and follow-ups to track.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-calendar (online)</a></td> <td>Review the day's meetings, timing, and preparation needs.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail (online)</a></td> <td>Find Gmail messages that need a reply or change your priorities.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/outlook-email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">outlook-email (online)</a></td> <td>Find Outlook messages that need a reply or change your priorities.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Find direct messages, mentions, decisions, and follow-ups that need attention.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">teams (online)</a></td> <td>Find Teams messages, decisions, and follow-ups that need attention.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read the approved running notes, trackers, or planning docs behind the day's work.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Set up my work chief of staff</p> <p>Suggested model：<code>gpt-6-luna</code> · Suggested reasoning effort：<code>xhigh</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Be my chief of staff.\n\nStart by checking the work tools and sources available to you, such as Slack or Teams, Gmail or Outlook, my calendar, documents, notes, and project trackers. Figure out what I'm working on, who I work with, what I've committed to, and what needs my attention.\n\nGive me a concise update covering:\n\n- what changed and what needs a decision;\n- approaching deadlines, meetings, and commitments;\n- messages that need a response;\n- what is blocked or waiting on someone; and\n- what can wait.\n\nLink to the original sources when possible, check the latest replies before resurfacing an older request, and tell me if an important source is unavailable. Separate confirmed facts from assumptions and don't repeat items that have already been resolved.\n\nSuggest next steps, draft replies, and prepare meeting briefs when useful. In the desktop app, when I ask you to delegate a project, create or continue a separate project task and share only the context it needs.\n\nSet up an hourly check if scheduled tasks are available. Review the connected sources, compare what you find with prior updates, and interrupt me only when a priority, deadline, blocker, decision, or message meaningfully changes. Stay quiet when there's nothing new. If you can't create the schedule, tell me instead of implying that it's active.\n\nApart from the hourly check I just requested, ask before creating a new project task, sending anything, editing documents, changing a schedule, or making commitments.\n\nStart by telling me what I should know today.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/project-teammate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Set up a project teammate (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-b5406e60cbfa0b68\">Scheduled tasks</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"what-to-expect\">What to expect</h2> <p>Give ChatGPT Work ongoing responsibility for staying on top of your work. In one thread, it can check the work tools you've connected every hour, bring together your priorities, prepare you for meetings, and flag messages, decisions, or commitments that need your attention. In the desktop app, it can also help you start or coordinate a separate task for a project when you ask.</p> <p>Use the sources that apply to your work, such as Slack or Teams, Gmail or Outlook, your calendar, documents, and project trackers. ChatGPT should tell you if it can't access a source rather than guess what's in it.</p> <p>Choose the surface that fits how you want your chief of staff to work:</p> <ul> <li><strong>ChatGPT on the web:</strong> Use connected work tools and an hourly <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">scheduled check (not in this local snapshot)</a> that can continue when your laptop is off. This is a good default when you want updates wherever you are.</li> <li><strong>ChatGPT desktop app:</strong> Use the same connected sources alongside local files and apps. Your chief of staff can also create, brief, and coordinate separate project teammates when you ask. Keep your computer on and the app running if a <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/automations?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">scheduled check (not in this local snapshot)</a> needs local files or desktop tools.</li> </ul> <p>Here's what an initial check and follow-up can look like:</p> <p><strong>Top priorities</strong></p> <ul> <li>Confirm the launch docs link with Priya before 9:15 AM for the 9:30 AM readiness review.</li> <li>Prepare an accurate customer update, respond to Finance, and review the weekly update.</li> </ul> <p><strong>What changed:</strong> Launch copy is approved, the missing docs link is the current blocker, and the earlier team-social request is resolved.</p> <p><strong>Draft reply:</strong> “Copy is approved. I'm checking the docs link now and will confirm it before the readiness review.” The reply stays unsent until you approve it.</p> <p><strong>Catch-up prompt:</strong> I'm back after time away. Catch me up on work by checking my available messages, email, calendar, documents, and project trackers. Show me what changed, include source links, and don't send or change anything.</p> <h2 id=\"make-it-your-own\">Make it your own</h2> <ol> <li>Start a thread using the starter prompt.</li> <li>Connect the messaging, email, calendar, and document sources relevant to your work.</li> <li>Review the first update and point out anything important, resolved, or missing.</li> <li>Keep using the same thread for follow-ups, meeting preparation, and draft replies.</li> <li>On desktop, ask it to create or continue a separate task when a project needs its own teammate.</li> <li>Review the hourly heartbeat and adjust its schedule when needed.</li> </ol> <p>The starter prompt authorizes an hourly check. ChatGPT should ask before creating another task, sending messages, updating documents, changing the schedule, or making commitments.</p> <p><strong>Adjust the hourly heartbeat</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check my connected work sources every hour. Tell me only about meaningful changes, approaching deadlines, decisions, blockers, or messages that need my attention. Don't repeat resolved items. Apart from this hourly check, keep everything read-only unless I approve a specific action.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Catch up after time away</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Catch me up on what changed while I was away. Review my available messages, email, calendar, documents, and project trackers. Show me decisions, deadlines, blockers, and messages that need a reply. Link to the original sources and tell me if anything is missing. Don't send or change anything.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Start a project teammate on desktop</strong></p> <p>When one project needs its own focused working space, ask your chief of staff to <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/project-teammate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">set up a project teammate (not in this local snapshot)</a> and share the relevant context.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Create a separate teammate task for [project]. Brief it on what we're trying to accomplish, the relevant messages, documents, decisions, and open questions. Give it only the context it needs, keep its work separate from other projects, and tell me where to find it. Ask before sending messages, editing documents, or making commitments.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Continue an existing project teammate</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Check on my existing [project] teammate. Give it this follow-up: [what you need]. Then tell me what changed, what's blocked, and what needs my review. Don't create a duplicate task, contact anyone, or change anything without my approval.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Prepare the next step</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use the latest context in this thread to draft the reply, handoff, or meeting brief I need next. Keep it concise, show the sources behind your recommendation, and don't send or share anything without my approval.\n</code></pre> <p>Connected sources and scheduled tasks depend on your plan and workspace settings. Set up scheduled tasks in chat rather than in a voice conversation.</p>"};
